 | Hair under helmets (`Gfx.Gear/Items/Helmets.cs` `PlaceHair`, `Gfx.Gear/Runtime/KitAssets.cs` `Worn`, `ShellLayers`) | the stage-chars hair shells and cards (§3.9), the generated helmets (§3.11) | per triangle at wear time: each hair vertex placed free, under or over the helmet's analytic shell; fur-shell layers hidden by their root, cards by corners and edge midpoints; scalp hair never shows through a face plate's openings | project code | own |
 | Cloud layer and its shadows (`Gfx.Engine/Atmosphere/CloudLayer.cs`, `GlslLib.CloudLib`, the sky composite in `PostEffects`) | none (procedural value-noise fBm; no texture) | a slab of fBm density, a pure function of world xz and a fixed scene offset; sky lighting with self-shading and a forward lobe; the shadow multiplies the sun's light in `shadowPcf` | project code | own |
 | Gamut compression after the tone curve (`PostEffects` composite, CPU twin `GamutCompression.cs`); capped transmission chroma (`GroundCover`, `TreeEffects`) | the rendered frame | luminance-preserving compression of out-of-gamut chroma (knee 0.78, limit 0.88); half of the transmission chroma kept; a per-tuft hue jitter | project code | own |
-| Disarmed crowd, dropped kit, surrender poses, fallen settle (`Gfx.Chars/Crowd/CrowdKit.cs`, `CrowdRenderer`, `CrowdPoseVariants.DeriveSurrender`, the `@bind` bank clip, `TraceCrowd`) | the crowd LOD meshes (§3.12) and the CMU-derived `kneel` clip (§3.4, §3.9); the battle trace (§3.13), read only | per LOD mesh: islands rigidly bound to a hand or forearm that reach out of it found and split into weapon and shield index views, each laid flat by its principal axes; a surrender pose derived from the kneel by turning the arms and bowing the head; dropped kit and settle offsets pure functions of the trace and entity ids | project code (the surrender pose is a derivative of a CMU-derived clip: `LicenseRef-CMU-Mocap`, as the clip it is made from) | own / PROTOTYPE-ONLY (as the CMU base) |
+| Disarmed crowd, dropped kit, surrender poses, fallen settle (`Gfx.Chars/Crowd/CrowdKit.cs`, `CrowdRenderer`, `CrowdPoseVariants.DeriveSurrender`, the `@bind` bank clip, `TraceCrowd`) | the crowd LOD meshes (§3.12) and the CMU-derived `kneel` clip (§3.4, §3.9); the battle trace (§3.13), read only | per LOD mesh: islands rigidly bound to a hand or forearm that reach out of it found and split into weapon and shield index views, each laid flat by its principal axes, plus a view without the shield (a routing soldier who has thrown it away); a surrender pose derived from the kneel by turning the arms and bowing the head; dropped kit and settle offsets pure functions of the trace and entity ids | project code (the surrender pose is a derivative of a CMU-derived clip: `LicenseRef-CMU-Mocap`, as the clip it is made from) | own / PROTOTYPE-ONLY (as the CMU base) |
 | Burnt-out carts (`Gfx.Demo/Scenes/Bench/BurningWreck.cs`) | the structure kit's plank and log materials (§3.10) | geometry built in code (boxes and tubes), charred tint | project code | own |
 | Smoke soft particles, dense young smoke, flame tongues (`Gfx.Engine/Rendering/SmokeLayer.cs`) | the G-buffer's linear depth | procedural billboards (no texture) | project code | own |
 | River banks, trodden village ground, darker temperate rock, water contact edge (`EnvironmentScenery.RiverBanks`, `TrampledGround`, `TerrainMaterials`, `G2TerrainEffects`, `EnvWater`) | the render1 terrain bake (§3.8), the env bakes (§3.10) | splat weights moved (rock and sand near water to silt, earth and turf); tint and roughness changes; the water's alpha and foam from the scene depth | project code | own |
